index 4bd35fa..98f85cf 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -9,6 +9,8 @@ ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
 
+- Session authentication: Livewire login/register screens, logout, password reset (request + token update), and signed e-mail verification. Includes per-IP/e-mail login throttling, registration throttling, reset-link throttling, a single app-wide password rule (min 8, letters, mixed case, numbers), and `MustVerifyEmail` on the user model.
+- pt-BR-first UI translations (`lang/pt_BR/ui.php` + `lang/en/ui.php`) and app defaults (`APP_NAME=PegaFila`, `APP_LOCALE=pt_BR`, `APP_FALLBACK_LOCALE=en`); tests run in pt-BR.
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
